{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06929","headline":"白龙窟泛舟寄天台学道者 · 常建","name":"白龙窟泛舟寄天台学道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夕映翠山深，余晖在龙窟。\n扁舟沧浪意，澹澹花影没。\n西浮入天色，南望对云阙。\n因忆莓苔峰，初阳濯玄发。\n泉萝两幽映，松鹤间清越。\n碧海莹子神，玉膏泽人骨。\n忽然爲枯木，微兴遂如兀。\n应寂中有天，明心外无物。\n环回从所泛，夜静犹不歇。\n澹然意无限，身与波上月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}